      "detailed_description": "<h1>DISCORD</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244630/extras/627c374e1fe2a46bf1db3dbbe22ee898.poster.avif?t=1760283120\" width=780 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244630/extras/627c374e1fe2a46bf1db3dbbe22ee898.webm?t=1760283120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244630/extras/627c374e1fe2a46bf1db3dbbe22ee898.mp4?t=1760283120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>Lovux</strong> is a minimalist logic puzzle where the goal is to break all the glasses in the game area by wisely using various glass types and mechanics. The difficulty of the game increases gradually, thanks to new mechanics introduced every 10 levels.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Break the whole line by activating the breakers<br></li><li>Manage your moves wisely<br></li><li>Use different glass types to your advantage<br></li><li>Stay away from break the wrong glass!<br></li><li>Sometimes you'll have to think a bit</li></ul></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244630/extras/caa6c9e0020a1efdf8b4a6986d1ded7c.poster.avif?t=1760283120\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244630/extras/caa6c9e0020a1efdf8b4a6986d1ded7c.webm?t=1760283120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244630/extras/caa6c9e0020a1efdf8b4a6986d1ded7c.mp4?t=1760283120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>90 levels (from simple to insufferably difficult)<br></li><li>8 unique mechanics<br></li><li>New mechanics introduced every 10 levels<br></li><li>Unlimited undo option<br></li><li>No text<br></li><li>Minimalist interface<br></li><li>Simple, relaxing, peaceful puzzle experience<br></li><li>Smooth animations for a fluid experience<br></li><li>Full gamepad support<br></li><li>Level Editor (Separated DLC)<br></li><li>Steam Achievements<br></li><li>Steam Cloud</li></ul></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Music and Sound Design by Emre Akdeniz &lt;3</h2>",
